{
	"Name": "Okta - Authentication & Sessions - Okta Password Spray from One IP",
	"Description": "Alert: Okta\nGroup: Authentication & Sessions\nMITRE ATT&CK: Credential Access / T1110.003\nSchedule: every 15 minutes over the previous 15 minutes (edit the scheduled search to change it)\nTuning: okta_user_allowlist / okta_ip_allowlist keys \"<login without domain>|Okta Password Spray from One IP\" or \"<ip>|Okta Password Spray from One IP\"\n\nOne client IP with failed authentications (INVALID_CREDENTIALS) for three or more different users within the search window: the classic password-spray pattern.\n\nFalse positives: a shared egress IP (corporate NAT, VPN concentrator) during a password change rollout; tune with okta_ip_allowlist.\n\nReference(s):\n- https://detection.fyi/elastic/detection-rules/integrations/okta/credential_access_multiple_device_token_hashes_for_single_okta_session/\n- https://github.com/elastic/detection-rules/tree/main/rules/integrations/okta/credential_access_okta_authentication_for_multiple_users_from_single_source.toml",
	"GUID": "0eeb706e-23c8-5fac-9358-5ee4a2227d2f",
